5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a structure that is sustainable but doesn't alienate new members or create unnecessary friction. I'll look into the taster evening forms from non-joiners and the minute books from the named-grade years.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I agree that sustainability is key. To ensure we don't overburden our future treasurer, I'll examine the outgoing treasurer's logged hours and the bank statements on last year's renewals.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I believe it is important to understand the actual usage of our facilities. I will look into the tally of the sign-in sheets and the rota against the attendance record.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I want to understand why the atmosphere has shifted lately. I'll look into the weekday turnout since the summer outings and the reports on the quieter members at the winter social.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We can't just guess the numbers again. I'm going to look into last year's ledger of outgoings and the sign-up records for mid-year joiners to see what we're actually dealing with.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"It seems we have a comprehensive plan. By covering the financial records, attendance patterns, and historical precedents, we should have enough data to avoid the guesswork of previous years. Does anyone feel we've missed a critical angle?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I believe we have covered the essential bases. We are looking at the administrative burden, the financial reality, and the social dynamics. I am satisfied with this distribution of research.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. By examining both the formal records and the informal feedback, we can ensure our decision is grounded in reality rather than assumptions. I look forward to seeing what we discover.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'm satisfied as well. Let's just make sure we're honest about what the data shows when we return, even if it contradicts our initial instincts. I'm curious to see if the numbers match the mood.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm with you, Shunichi. I don't care if the news is bad, as long as it's the truth. I'm tired of pretending we know what we're doing while the money disappears. Let's just get the facts.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Since we are all in agreement on the research tasks, I suggest we move forward. There is no need for further deliberation until we have the results of our investigations.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I concur. Let us proceed to the investigation phase so we can bring concrete evidence to the table. I shall see you all shortly with my findings.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. Let us take this time to review the records carefully. I will be interested to see how the attendance patterns align with the concerns we've all noticed.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'm ready. Let's get to it. I'll be interested to see if the data explains the hesitation I've been sensing. See you all in the next round.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,Fine by me. Let's stop talking and start looking. I'll find out exactly where the money is going and how many people are actually joining. See you all soon.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
