71,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,It's a win for the club's atmosphere. Let's get this sorted so people can just show up and enjoy themselves without thinking about their wallets.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
