73,3,2,talk,Takumi,,Finally. We've got a plan that actually makes sense and doesn't rely on luck. Let's just get it done.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
